## 15. Next build/release setup

When ready for internal testing:

```bash
npm install -g eas-cli
eas login
eas build:configure
```

Build iOS simulator:

```bash
eas build --profile development --platform ios
```

Build Android:

```bash
eas build --profile development --platform android
```

